| Cross-section triangle `(Y,Z)` | `(12,-28)`, `(22,-28)`, `(17,-13)` mm |
| Triangle area and centroid | `A=75 mm²`; `(Y,Z)=(17,-23)` mm |
| Anchored prism | `X=-50..-30 mm`; three positive-Jacobian C3D4s |
| Loaded prism | `X=-30..-10 mm`; three positive-Jacobian C3D4s |
